{{define "main"}}
    <div class="register-head">
        <h1>No accounts yet</h1>
    </div>
    <p>This database has no accounts, so there is no register to show.</p>
    <p><a class="cta" href="/accounts/new">Add your first account</a></p>
    <p class="muted">
        To see what a register looks like before entering anything of your own, start a second
        copy with <code>go run ./cmd/checkbook -demo</code>. It serves a small sample household
        from memory on its own port, so this one can stay open, and it writes nothing to disk.
    </p>
{{end}}
